; name: Square to round
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Turns a square blank round on the rotary axis (along X; zero on the axis, at the −X end where the chuck is): a flat pass wrapped round the blank, each line a ring at the cut’s radius, level by level from the circle the corners turn in down to the diameter asked for, with a Ø12 end mill; the ends stay square for the chuck and the tailstock. Set the blank’s side and length, the square ends and the diameter with the variables.
; 
